  lines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: 'Do you really believe that anyone here was smiling during the massacre
      ? '
  - speaker: 0
    text: What are you talking about ?!
  - speaker: 1
    text: Some were crying, others ran away in vain and I even saw one who was praying.
      So maybe there actually was someone who wanted to smile ?
